nal benefits of multiple servings of fruits and vegetables."},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"Caution: As with any dietary supplement, consult your healthcare practitioner before using this product, especially if you are pregnant, nursing, giving product to children, anticipate surgery, take medication on a regular basis or are otherwise under medical supervision."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"Keep out of reach of children."},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Store in a cool, dry place.\r\nThe density of the powdered ingredients in this product naturally vary from lot to lot and require space in the container at the time of packaging. Over time the powders settle, causing the container to appear less full than when it was first packaged. This product is sold by weight and not by volume."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Do not use if safety seal is broken or missing."},{"type":"Precautions re: Allergies","notes":"Manufactured in a facility that also processes egg, milk, soy, wheat, tree nuts and sesame."},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Please recycle\r\nF.P.O."},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"Certified B Corporation\r\nCertified Renewable Energy\r\nWe buy 100% certified renewable energy\r\nGreen-e.org\r\nCertified\r\nCarbonfund.org\r\nA carbon neutral product"},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"More greens per serving\r\nSuper Green Formula"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Phytonutrient-dense superfoods\r\nSprouted & fermented ingredients\r\nMade with young cereal grass juices"},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"Whole Food Dietary Supplement"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Suggested use: Adults mix 1 scoop (2 table